  "solution": "<div class=\"with-figure\"><div>Gọi <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> là tâm <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình chóp đều nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vì <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông cạnh <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>a</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> và diện tích <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>S</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>9</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Thể tích khối chóp <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></semantics></math>.</div><div class=\"side-figure\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/4075824db136136ac40b79b88463a5077236de45ad8c7e9ef52fc86722bf3e81.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div></div>",
